{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>At evening, when the sun comes down — the appointed time.</b> There are three time-points: ״בערב תשחטנו״ — at evening you slaughter it — from the sixth hour onward; ״כבא השמש תאכלנו״ — when the sun comes down you eat it; and ״מועד צאתך תשרפנו״ — at the appointed time of your departure you burn it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:48:36.754542704Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}